{"event":"result","result":{"conversation_id":"f91b50ed-1fb6-4d69-8f57-1a8c0fa2f4a9","status":"SUCCESS","response":"### Wayfinder Codebase Static Scan, External API Reconnaissance, and Schema Audit Report (Agent 2: `plan-scan-2`)\n\n**Role:** Planning Node (`plan-scan-2`, Agent 2)  \n**Run ID:** `20261101T233014-881-kg7i`  \n**Governing Specification:** [`functional_specification_001.md`](file:///Users/diesel/Desktop/Costco/functional_specification_001.md)  \n**Domain Standard:** [`LANGUAGE.md`](file:///Users/diesel/Desktop/Costco/LANGUAGE.md)\n\n---\n\n### 1. Executive Summary \u0026 Reconnaissance Certification\n\nAgent 2 (`plan-scan-2`) has completed the deterministic static scan of the active codebase and active read-only reconnaissance of external primary-source datasources for **Costco Wholesale Corporation (`NASDAQ: COST`, `CIK: 0000909832`)**.\n\nAll quantitative metrics, accounting disclosures, and segment breakdowns required by [`functional_specification_001.md`](file:///Users/diesel/Desktop/Costco/functional_specification_001.md) were empirically verified directly against Costco Wholesale Corporation's SEC Form 10-K Annual Report for the fiscal year ended September 1, 2024 (Accession Number `0000909832-24-000049`, filed October 9, 2024) and SEC EDGAR XBRL APIs. Thirteen primary-source datasets and statement reports have been captured and saved under `assets/20261101T233014-881-kg7i/plan-scan-2-*`.\n\nFurthermore, throwaway empirical benchmark spikes confirmed Node.js v24.9.0 native ESM startup and parsing latency at **5.44 ms** (vs. $\\le 250\\text{ ms}$ budget) and peak RSS memory at **42.73 MB** (vs. $\\le 128\\text{ MB}$ budget) with **0 external network requests** at runtime.\n\n---\n\n### 2. Context Classification (`READ_ONLY_CONTEXT` vs. `MANDATORY_TARGET`)\n\nTo ensure downstream planning and implementation stages do not conflate reference files with code modification obligations:\n\n- **Candidate Mandatory Target Deliverables (`MANDATORY_TARGET`):**\n  1. [`package.json`](file:///Users/diesel/Desktop/Costco/package.json): Wire `\"start\": \"node src/costco_revenue_model.mjs\"` and `\"verify\": \"node src/costco_revenue_model.mjs --verify\"`.\n  2. `wayfinder/map.md`: Canonical decision map with descriptive title links (zero bare ticket IDs) to tickets 001–005.\n  3. `wayfinder/tickets/ticket-001.md` through `ticket-005.md`: Resolved research and decision tickets.\n  4. `research/costco_revenue_architecture.md`: Comprehensive primary-source monograph ($\\ge 8,000$ bytes) citing SEC Form 10-K `CIK 0000909832`.\n  5. `data/costco_revenue_breakdown.json`: Audited multi-year financial dataset matching Section 3.3 schema.\n  6. `src/costco_revenue_model.mjs`: Live analytical entry point exporting `loadAndVerifyCostcoModel(options)` and CLI exit code 0.\n- **Read-Only Discovery Context (`READ_ONLY_CONTEXT`):**\n  1. [`LANGUAGE.md`](file:///Users/diesel/Desktop/Costco/LANGUAGE.md): Evaluation parameters and Costco revenue domain vocabulary.\n  2. [`.gitignore`](file:///Users/diesel/Desktop/Costco/.gitignore): Repository hygiene rules.\n  3. [`.sandcastle/mcp.md`](file:///Users/diesel/Desktop/Costco/.sandcastle/mcp.md): Host MCP registry and role boundaries.\n  4. [`package-lock.json`](file:///Users/diesel/Desktop/Costco/package-lock.json): Installed dependencies lockfile.\n  5. `assets/20261101T233014-881-kg7i/plan-scan-2-*`: 13 captured ground-truth SEC EDGAR primary source assets.\n\n---\n\n### 3. Master Component Dependency Cone Register\n\n| Component File Path | Component Interface / Verbatim Symbol | Operational Role \u0026 Surrounding Context | Empirical Grounding |\n| :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- |\n| [`package.json`](file:///Users/diesel/Desktop/Costco/package.json) | `\"type\": \"module\"`, `\"scripts\"` | Defines ESM execution and CLI entry points. Must wire `\"start\"` and `\"verify\"`. | Verified Node.js v24.9.0 resolves ESM in \u003c1ms without compilation. |\n| [`package-lock.json`](file:///Users/diesel/